{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 34, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark what gentle wanderer seeketh solace in Nippon’s fair embrace\nLend thine ears and let mine quill weave thee a path most grand and sweet\nUpon the morrow of thine arrival in fair Tokyo’s bustling embrace\nDo thou awake ere the sun’s golden tongue doth lick the eastern sky\nThen forth to Asakusa’s sacred shrine thou must repair with haste\nWhere Kannon’s gentle gaze shall bless thy soul anew\nPartake of tempura’s crisp embrace at a humble eatery near\nAnd let thy taste buds dance with joy untold and sheer\n\nOn the second morn do thou ascend the towering spire of Tokyo’s Skytree tall\nWherefrom thou shalt behold the city’s heart laid bare before thy eyes\nThen wander through Akihabara’s neon-lit maze where geeks and gamers play\nAnd fill thy satchel with trinkets strange and bright to bear homeward on thy way\n\nThe third day shall see thee depart for Kyoto fair where temples stand in quiet grace\nVisit Kinkaku-ji’s golden pavilion where waters mirror heaven’s face\nThen through Arashiyama’s bamboo grove thou shalt tread with footsteps light\nAnd lose thyself in nature’s art until the fading day doth blight\n\nOn dawn’s fourth light do thou arise and journey to Nara’s ancient keep\nWhere deer with eyes so gentle roam both bold and free\nThen feast upon kaiseki’s many delicacies fit for royalty\nAnd let thy palate sing with glee\n\nThe fifth day call thee to Osaka’s lively streets where takoyaki’s savory bite\nDoth lure the hungry and the merry down each winding lane and alight\nNext do thou embark on train or boat to Hiroshima’s solemn shore\nWhere peace doth dwell in silence deep and evermore\n\nFrom there take heed and venture forth to Miyajima’s floating shrine\nWhere torii gate doth rise from waves a sight both rare and divine\nThen return to Tokyo’s heart where thy tale in Japan doth end\nWith one last supper’s feast to bid the land thy fond farewell again\n\nThus ends thy journey through this isle of wonders vast and wide\nMay memories sweet and moments rare forever in thy heart abide.", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.16029712557792664}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.0027155925054103136}, {"token": " what", "logprob": -6.221748352050781}, {"token": " gentle", "logprob": -3.9621634483337402}, {"token": " wander", "logprob": -3.3450684547424316}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.0016505202511325479}, {"token": " seek", "logprob": -1.9524990320205688}, {"token": "eth", "logprob": -1.2872085571289062}, {"token": " sol", "logprob": -1.2669651508331299}, {"token": "ace", "logprob": -0.0007065422250889242}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.37133288383483887}, {"token": " Nippon", "logprob": -1.9863603115081787}, {"token": "’s", "logprob": -0.1492718607187271}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.2636120319366455}, {"token": " embrace", "logprob": -0.6577376127243042}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.8397386074066162}, {"token": "L", "logprob": -2.153858184814453}, {"token": "end", "logprob": -0.06105054169893265}, {"token": " th", "logprob": -0.05569298192858696}, {"token": "ine", "logprob": -0.001128156203776598}, {"token": " ears", "logprob": -1.5097193717956543}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.647333025932312}, {"token": " let", "logprob": -1.0886732339859009}, {"token": " mine", "logprob": -1.570547103881836}, {"token": " qu", "logprob": -0.29922357201576233}, {"token": "ill", "logprob": -0.0064066024497151375}, {"token": " we", "logprob": -0.49182766675949097}, {"token": "ave", "logprob": -4.60137271147687e-05}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.5174674987792969}, {"token": "e", "logprob": -0.00706590386107564}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.27950504422187805}, {"token": " path", "logprob": -1.0364303588867188}, {"token": " most", "logprob": -0.20811301469802856}, {"token": " grand", "logprob": -1.2527340650558472}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -1.8288850784301758}, {"token": " sweet", "logpro